# Produced on demand by scripts/third_party_notices.py for a look at the
# dependency licence picture. Not tracked: nothing mcp-xray publishes
# redistributes those packages, so the file is documentation rather than a
# notice anyone is owed, and committing it would churn on every bump. CI runs
# the same script as a licence gate, which is the half that earns its keep.
THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md
